unmodified upstream binary, verified against Proton's published SHA-512 before packaging.

## Download

| File | For | SHA-256 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ProtonDrive-CLI-{{VERSION}}-GUI-{{GUI_VERSION}}-x86_64.AppImage` | Intel/AMD | `{{SHA256_X86_64}}` |
| `ProtonDrive-CLI-{{VERSION}}-GUI-{{GUI_VERSION}}-aarch64.AppImage` | ARM64 | `{{SHA256_AARCH64}}` |

Verify: `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS`

## Run

```bash
chmod +x ProtonDrive-CLI-{{VERSION}}-GUI-{{GUI_VERSION}}-x86_64.AppImage
./ProtonDrive-CLI-{{VERSION}}-GUI-{{GUI_VERSION}}-x86_64.AppImage --help
./ProtonDrive-CLI-{{VERSION}}-GUI-{{GUI_VERSION}}-x86_64.AppImage auth login   # first run
```

FUSE needed: Arch `pacman -S fuse2` · Debian/Ubuntu `apt install libfuse2t64` · Fedora `dnf install fuse-libs` — or use `APPIMAGE_EXTRACT_AND_RUN=1`.

